# Cloudflare Pages headers for tracker.goinwardout.com
# The catalog files are large (~4 MB total) and change only when the ETL
# reruns — let browsers keep them for a day; Cloudflare's edge cache +
# brotli handle the rest. App code revalidates hourly so pushes show up.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/data/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400

/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400
